      "trackName": "Alien Hero 10: DNA Watch",
      "description": "Turn your device into the ultimate galaxy defender tool. This app simulates a powerful alien transformation device with realistic 3D graphics and sound effects. Experience the thrill of morphing into different heroes directly from your wrist.\nHow to Play:\n\t1\tRotate the crown or swipe the dial to cycle through different alien DNA.\n\t2\tChoose your favorite hero from the holographic interface.\n\t3\tTap the screen to activate the transformation sequence.\n\t4\tEnjoy the authentic transformation lights and sounds.\nFeatures:\n\t•\tIntuitive watch-style controls.\n\t•\tA wide collection of alien heroes to unlock.",
